; Per-user Android SDK, NDK r25b and JDK 11 paths for Quest builds. Nothing here is committed.
; - For the editor (Project Settings, Platforms > Android SDK, and packaging from the editor): copy this file to
;   Config/UserEngine.ini (git ignores it).
; - For command-line builds (UnrealBuildTool, RunUAT): UnrealBuildTool reads these keys without the project, so
;   either set ANDROID_HOME, NDKROOT and JAVA_HOME in the environment, or put the same section in
;   %LOCALAPPDATA%\Unreal Engine\Engine\Config\UserEngine.ini (per user, every project).
[/Script/AndroidPlatformEditor.AndroidSDKSettings]
SDKPath=(Path="C:/Android/sdk")
NDKPath=(Path="C:/Android/sdk/ndk/android-ndk-r25b")
JavaPath=(Path="C:/Java/jdk-11")
